WEBVTT

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:38.980
Led by Filia, a priestess
of the Fire Dragon King...

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:41.150
...we've been on our
way to her temple.

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:43.720
She says she's had a prophecy
about coming destruction...

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:47.320
...and says we have to save the world,
but don't ask me what it is!

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:50.290
Oh, and some servant of Gaav,
the Demon Dragon King...

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:52.400
...named Valgaav has
shown up, too.

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:56.630
You know, I don't think now's a good
time to go looking for revenge.

00:01:56.710 --> 00:02:00.440
Anyway, what does that prophecy
of destruction really mean?

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:02.910
And what are we
supposed to do about it?

00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:06.750
To learn all that, we set off for
the temple of the Fire Dragon King.

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:29.630
Okay, so we finally made it to
the temple of the Fire Dragon King.

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:32.500
And look at the condition
it's in when we arrive.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:35.400
That's YOUR fault, isn't it?!

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:38.610
DRAGON SLAVE!!!

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:44.420
All right! Safe by a hair!

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:46.850
Thank goodness! Thank goodness!

00:02:53.930 --> 00:02:57.370
If you hadn't
started the ruins moving...

00:02:57.430 --> 00:03:01.060
...the temple wouldn't
have been destroyed!

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:06.640
Perhaps this is the
first stage of the destruction...

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:07.840
...your prophecy mentioned.

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:13.940
Don't you dare try
misstating the obvious!

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:17.010
This time it was all YOUR
fault, wasn't it?!

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:17.880
Forgive me.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:20.720
Look, you can't undo
what's been done, right?

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:23.060
Quite right!

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:26.580
Exactly! You'll never get anywhere
if you worry about the past.

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:29.660
All that is built
must eventually crumble.

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:31.200
This is just fate!

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:33.560
Yeah, yeah! It's fate!

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:39.570
You all couldn't care less about
anyone else, could you?!

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:41.870
N- No, that's not true, but...

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:45.240
I'm going to make sure you
take responsibility for this!

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:49.380
Well, I think that's my
cue to get out of here.

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:52.280
Hey! Xellos! You're just
running away to save yourself?!

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:56.660
Oh, not at all! But this is the
temple of the Fire Dragon King.

00:03:56.730 --> 00:03:58.520
It wouldn't do
for a Monster like me...

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:00.720
...to hang around here
for very long, would it?

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:01.590
See you!

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:05.400
Hey! Xellos, you jerk!
You Monster! Snake in the grass!

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:07.990
TAKE ME WITH YOU!!!

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:11.570
Look!

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:15.470
Golden dragons!

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:23.220
That's... The Supreme Elder!

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:23.980
Supreme Elder?

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:32.290
Is this how you people ALWAYS
have to enter a scene?!

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:06.660
Those people there are the
elders who lead this temple.

00:05:17.410 --> 00:05:18.470
Supreme Elder...

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:22.480
These are the ones?

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:25.810
Um, uh, this is, uh...

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:30.580
Do not worry yourselves over
destroying a part of our temple.

00:05:31.050 --> 00:05:31.820
A PART?

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:33.620
This is just a part of it?

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:38.650
Oh, really! There's nothing to
worry about then, is there?

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:39.790
Thank goodness!

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:48.130
Visitors, this way, please.

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:49.600
Um... Uh, sure.

00:06:07.390 --> 00:06:09.980
You must be tired
after your long journey.

00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:12.430
Rest here and eat all you wish.

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:17.130
All RIGHT! You heard
the Supreme Elder!

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:20.960
Down the hatch!

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:27.400
Filia.

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:28.140
Yes, sir?

00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:30.810
I wish to have a word with you.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:34.280
Until later, my friends.

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:36.980
Okay! See you around!

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:44.790
Filia, are they the ones
you have selected?

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:46.100
Yes.

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:50.830
I see.

00:08:04.970 --> 00:08:07.310
The light still
has not been gathered?

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:11.470
Almayce, tell me why.

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:15.280
Why can't I fight them?

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:20.980
I told you the time is not yet right.
Be patient and it will come.

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:25.890
The time isn't right?
You told me yourself!

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:28.120
If I helped you
achieve your objective...

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:30.690
...then you would help
me exact my revenge!

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:34.230
Your revenge...
You wish to kill them?

00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:40.140
I do! Lina Inverse and Xellos, the
triggers for the death of Lord Gaav!

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:44.840
I want to see them both dead!
It is for that alone that I live on!

00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:49.110
And didn't you say you'd first
help me achieve my objective?

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:49.880
What?

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:56.350
The last of the five weapons
we need is still lost to us.

00:08:56.690 --> 00:09:00.490
Wasn't finding them your
task in this agreement?

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:07.560
Besides Ragud Mezegis,
we already possessed two others.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:12.200
The other two remained hidden
somewhere in this world.

00:09:12.680 --> 00:09:16.510
One is known as the Sword
of Light. Gorun Nova...

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:19.740
But the location of the final
one remains a mystery!

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:24.080
Find it! Did you not give me
your word that you would?!

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:32.490
I understand your
desire for vengeance...

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:35.120
...but there is a
reason we must hurry.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:37.930
Very well!

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:53.310
<i>We need that power.
And that which will lead us to it...</i>

00:09:53.550 --> 00:09:55.880
<i>That is the final thing we need.</i>

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:07.990
Ah, that hit the spot!

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:09.790
I'm in heaven...

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:17.610
Are you finished
eating, everyone?

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:19.640
Mm! Couldn't eat another crumb.

00:10:19.710 --> 00:10:21.180
All finished!

00:10:21.710 --> 00:10:23.700
Well, then, if you'd
all come this way.

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:26.150
The Supreme Elder
is calling for you.

00:10:26.550 --> 00:10:29.350
At last.
He finally called for us.

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:32.410
What's goin' on?
Is dessert being served?

00:10:37.790 --> 00:10:44.600
<i>Now then... We finally learn
what they expect us to do.</i>

00:10:58.580 --> 00:10:59.480
Say what?

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:05.220
Don't lag about!

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:09.220
Hold it! What do you
want us to do?!

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:13.130
Rebuild the part of our temple
you wrecked, of course.

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:17.360
Huh?! But you said we didn't have
to worry about wrecking the temple!

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:20.870
You needn't worry about it.
Now fix it!

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:26.100
Those who cause trouble must
take responsibility for it, right?

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:28.280
Give us a break!

00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:29.810
Forget it.

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:34.480
Is this all you called
us out here to do?!

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:36.520
That meal was a dirty trick!

00:11:36.720 --> 00:11:39.850
We still don't know
if we should entrust you...

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:42.790
...with saving us from the
prophecized destruction.

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:45.190
You know, it doesn't
show on their faces...

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:47.820
...but I think these guys
are really mad at us.

00:11:47.900 --> 00:11:50.060
Why didn't they just
say so from the start?

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:55.140
Mr. Gourry really seems
to be enjoying this!

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:57.730
He gets to use those muscles
he was naturally born with.

00:11:58.210 --> 00:12:00.370
I leave this to you.

00:12:01.010 --> 00:12:03.500
Well, do your best, everyone.

00:12:03.650 --> 00:12:04.640
Huh?! Hey, Filia!

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:07.510
You're responsible, too!
Help us out!

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:09.910
I have other duties.

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:11.420
Why?

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:15.730
Miss Lina!
Miss Lina, please work, too!

00:12:16.230 --> 00:12:18.860
Otherwise we're
never going to finish!

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:26.740
All right! Let's do this!

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:31.630
Supreme Elder, are you sure
we should be doing this?

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:40.450
Miss Lina...

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.960
Filia, I ask you again.

00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:49.860
Are those people really the
ones spoken of in the prophecy?

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:52.530
Y- Yes! I think...

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:55.160
We can't depend on that!

00:12:55.230 --> 00:12:58.030
Didn't you ask
that Knight of Ceiphied?

00:12:58.200 --> 00:13:01.300
She... said no.

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:05.040
The Knight of Ceiphied recommended
Miss Lina and her friends, though.

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:08.710
But, if she refused...

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:12.680
We're supposed to entrust saving
the world to a bunch of people...

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:15.510
...who have already wrecked
part of our temple?!

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:22.820
Filia. You must have come to
know them in your journey here.

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:24.690
Do you believe them to be...

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:28.600
...the ones spoken of in the
prophecy of destruction?

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:30.030
Well...

00:13:30.230 --> 00:13:31.330
What is it?

00:13:32.070 --> 00:13:36.840
I do believe Miss Lina and the others
are ones the prophecy speaks of!

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:43.710
I've traveled with them for
a while now. In that time...

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:49.220
I don't know how to say this,
but there are some things...

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:54.350
...that let you succeed beyond
mere skill. And they have that!

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:59.200
Something that lets them
succeed beyond mere skill...

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:04.060
Although it sometimes goes
out of control, like this time.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:08.570
They were able to destroy
both Hellmaster Phibrizzo...

00:14:08.640 --> 00:14:11.270
...and Gaav,
the Demon Dragon King.

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:14.140
And that, with all
our power as dragons...

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:17.580
...was something
we could never do!

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:19.750
You think there's a great
difference between...

00:14:19.820 --> 00:14:22.550
...those who can accomplish
something and those who can't?

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:24.150
Besides that...

00:14:24.220 --> 00:14:27.250
The Knight of Ceiphied said
something to me from the start.

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:31.460
The " power between light and
darkness" mentioned in the prophecy...

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:35.730
...didn't refer to the power of
Ceiphied that she controls, she said.

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:39.000
That's why she sent
me to find Miss Lina.

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:42.330
The power between
light and darkness...

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:45.070
Something that lets you
succeed beyond mere skill...

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:48.240
Filia.

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:49.110
Yes?!

00:14:49.480 --> 00:14:52.010
"...by the power you and I possess!"

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:54.180
DRAGON SLAVE!!!

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:03.520
That takes care of that.

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:06.560
This is heresy!
Construction is all about...

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:09.120
...working with your hands
and getting sweaty!

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:11.330
Leave it to a muscle man
to object to this.

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:13.500
We have to finish
this up soon, right?

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:16.870
That's it for the cleanup. All that's
left is rebuilding the temple.

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:19.240
All right! We'll take care
of this all at once!

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:33.520
All right! Good job!

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:37.830
Okay, dragons. How about you
get these over to the temple?

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:39.430
Huh? Us?

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:42.990
Of course you! We're fixing
YOUR temple, right?

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:45.330
Where's the harm in
you just doing this?

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:46.500
But...

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:48.770
Quit arguing and do it!

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:51.030
You all may live for
centuries, but we don't!

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:53.080
And we're not hanging
around here that long!

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:54.300
Y- Yes, ma'am!

00:15:58.480 --> 00:16:01.350
BU BRYMER SPECIAL!

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:13.320
Oh, I get it. She's using
a variation on a golem spell.

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:17.160
Let's see...
Put that up there, will you?

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:18.530
Sure thing!

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:23.500
All right! That giant
body comes in handy!

00:16:23.570 --> 00:16:25.540
Heh-heh...
This is a piece of cake!

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:37.950
So, where do you want
the next load taken?

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:40.150
Take the next batch over there.

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:55.270
Is it supposed
to look like that?

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:58.640
It, uh... It doesn't look
that good, you know?

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:01.800
What sort of plans
were you using, Lina?

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:03.940
Huh? What do you think?
These.

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:08.980
Miss Lina doesn't have much
artistic sense, does she?

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:11.110
- What did you say?!
- Nothing!

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:12.450
I see...

00:17:12.890 --> 00:17:18.060
They're as lively a bunch
as you claimed they were.

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:19.460
Yes, sir.

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:26.100
It's been a long time since our
people have had such wild spirits.

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:31.010
Humans live much shorter
lives than our kind.

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:34.110
They may make up for that
by living much more fully.

00:17:34.850 --> 00:17:38.040
And they affected
everyone here, as well.

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:43.210
Filia, I understand your reasoning
in selecting these people.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:44.220
Yes, sir!

00:17:44.420 --> 00:17:47.650
Hey, what's the big idea?!
I'm not done yet!

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:50.050
You've done quite
enough, thank you.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:52.790
So, are you going to make
us wash dishes now?

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:58.230
Where are we?

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:00.070
Quite a large room, isn't it?

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:03.740
This is the great cathedral
of the Dragon race.

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:06.370
Did you have to build
it so incredibly big?!

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:08.970
The Supreme Elder...

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:12.410
You've done well.

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:13.280
I guess.

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:16.090
We were testing to see
if you were the ones...

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:18.420
...spoken of in the
prophecy of destruction.

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:19.450
And?

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:25.050
Well, it's a good thing you cleared
away the temple's rubble as well.

00:18:25.130 --> 00:18:26.720
That's all you've got to say?

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:27.630
Please, please!

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:29.730
Look, I'm sick of this.

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:31.790
You may not know what
the prophecy means...

00:18:31.870 --> 00:18:34.460
...but do you have to be
so evasive all the time?

00:18:34.540 --> 00:18:37.970
If you don't trust us, why not
take care of this yourselves?!

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:41.280
That's a good point.
Why doesn't the Dragon race...

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:45.150
...just take care of this
prophecy of destruction itself?

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:49.520
Why not just ask the Fire Dragon
King you worship to handle it?

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:54.320
That would go against
the prophecy.

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:57.930
And there's the simple reason
that we <i>cannot</i> do it.

00:18:58.100 --> 00:18:58.750
Reason?

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:02.400
Yes. We must keep this from
the Monster race's watchmen...

00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:04.060
...who lurk in the darkness.

00:19:04.130 --> 00:19:05.430
The Monster race's watchmen?

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:08.870
Thanks to your destroying
both Gaav and Phibrizzo...

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:11.100
...the Monster race
have grown impatient.

00:19:11.780 --> 00:19:15.340
The truth is, their power is
now severely diminished.

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:18.350
The danger is that they'll be
on guard for any chance...

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:20.940
...to diminish the
powers of the Gods.

00:19:21.020 --> 00:19:23.180
For that reason, neither
the Fire Dragon King...

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:26.990
...nor we who serve him
can risk using our power.

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:29.920
Sounds like a pretty
poor reason to me.

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:35.990
And the prophecy arrived with the
appearance of that disturbing light.

00:19:36.600 --> 00:19:39.540
It lies too far away for
even we who possess wings...

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:43.510
...and the prophecy indicates
something is behind its appearance.

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:48.380
For that reason, we must be very
careful in selecting who goes there.

00:19:49.550 --> 00:19:55.710
I get you... So, after calling us
out here, what have you decided?

00:19:56.590 --> 00:20:00.150
To be honest, I still don't
know if we should be...

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:03.920
...entrusting the fate of
the world to you people.

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:08.460
However, there's no clear
evidence that we shouldn't do it.

00:20:08.530 --> 00:20:13.300
For that reason, we've
decided to gamble on you.

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:15.660
Not exactly a master
of tact, are you?

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:17.140
You disapprove?

00:20:17.810 --> 00:20:21.140
We don't know exactly what
you dragons are up to here...

00:20:21.210 --> 00:20:24.440
...and you haven't given us a reason
to go along with this, have you?

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:26.950
Lina does have a point.

00:20:27.220 --> 00:20:29.190
B- But, if nobody does
anything about this...

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:31.950
...there's no telling what horrible
thing might happen, right?

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:34.010
Yeah, you've got a
good point, too.

00:20:37.230 --> 00:20:37.990
Wha?!

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:40.560
It's him!

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:43.930
That guy who was
with Valgaav before!

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:46.290
What?! You mean he's a?!

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:48.860
But how could he have
entered this sacred place?!

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:52.370
<i>Suddenly appearing inside
the dragons'temple...</i>

00:20:52.440 --> 00:20:54.600
<i>... is one of our
mysterious adversaries!</i>

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:58.210
